      en: ["Capital city of the Kié-Ntem Province.", "Strategically located at the border with Cameroon and Gabon.", "Home to the impressive Cathedral of Santiago el Mayor.", "Major transit point for goods within the CEMAC region.", "Coordinates are 2.1511° N, 11.3353° E.", "The city’s climate is tropical, with high rainfall year-round.", "Primary ethnic group is the Fang people.", "Serves as a key administrative hub for the northeastern region."],
