      en: ["Part of the Litoral province on the western coast.", "Located only a few kilometers north of the city of Bata.", "Traditional center for artisanal fishing activities.", "Surrounded by significant mangrove ecosystems.", "Important regional market for seafood products.", "Positioned directly on the coastal road heading north toward Cameroon."],
