      en: ["Located at the mouth of the Ntem River in the north", "Forms the natural international border with Cameroon", "Home to the ecologically significant Río Campo Reserve", "A known nesting site for rare species of sea turtles", "Economy revolves around fishing and cross-border trade", "Features modern road access to the regional hub of Bata"],
