      en: ["Bata-manga is a key administrative district within the city of Bata.", "The neighborhood experienced massive population growth after the year 2000.", "It is home to several important educational institutions and local markets.", "Infrastructure includes modern paved roads and new residential complexes.", "Manga is strategically located near the international Port of Bata.", "The district serves as a major commercial hub for the local Fang population."],
